    "category": "Open-Frame Dual Fuel Inverter, 3,500W Running / 4,250W Starting",
    "badge": "Best Inverter",
    "amazonUrl": "#",
    "pros": [
      "Rated 3,500 running and 4,250 starting watts on gasoline",
      "Dual fuel: 3,150 running watts on propane with the same 4,250 starting",
      "Up to 22 hours on gasoline and 21 on propane at 25 percent load",
      "Rated 64 dBA at 23 feet, quieter than conventional open frames",
      "Clean inverter power, TT-30R RV outlet and parallel capability"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "No CO shutoff listed on this model",
      "Recoil start only"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "Inverter quiet and long runtime with a true 3,500 running watts on gasoline and propane as a backup fuel.",
